{"id":"7443277cb04c8e58","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-theory-choice.md","title":"按明确要求选择真理理论","display":"df-truth-theory-choice — 按明确要求选择真理理论","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-theory-choice","aliases":["91-df-truth-theory-choice","91-df-theory-choice","91-df-truth-choice"],"display":"df-truth-theory-choice — 按明确要求选择真理理论","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-theory]]","[[91-df-truth-strength]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-theory-choice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-theory-choice</span><span>91-df-theory-choice</span><span>91-df-truth-choice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-theory-choice — 按明确要求选择真理理论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"024b320d234d188f\" href=\"?note=024b320d234d188f\" title=\"91-df-truth-theory\">91-df-truth-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c87db4d1858a0009\" href=\"?note=c87db4d1858a0009\" title=\"91-df-truth-strength\">91-df-truth-strength</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-truth-theory-choice-—-按明确要求选择真理理论-$\\mathrm{Choice}$\">df-truth-theory-choice — 按明确要求选择真理理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Choice}\">\\(\\mathrm{Choice}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak C\">\\(\\mathfrak C\\)</span> (候选真理理论类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> (明确给出的要求集合)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Meets}(\\mathcal T,r)\">\\(\\operatorname{Meets}(\\mathcal T,r)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 满足要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_R\">\\(\\preceq_R\\)</span> (要求相关的偏好预序)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Admissible}_R(\\mathfrak C)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\mathcal T\\in\\mathfrak C\n\\mid\n\\forall r\\in R\\,\\operatorname{Meets}(\\mathcal T,r)\n\\right\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Admissible}_R(\\mathfrak C)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\mathcal T\\in\\mathfrak C\n\\mid\n\\forall r\\in R\\,\\operatorname{Meets}(\\mathcal T,r)\n\\right\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\prec_R\\mathcal T\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal U\\preceq_R\\mathcal T\n\\land\\neg(\\mathcal T\\preceq_R\\mathcal U),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}choice}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Choice}(R,\\mathfrak C)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\mathcal T\\in\\operatorname{Admissible}_R(\\mathfrak C)\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\neg\\exists\\mathcal U\\in\\operatorname{Admissible}_R(\\mathfrak C)\\,\n(\\mathcal U\\prec_R\\mathcal T)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal U\\prec_R\\mathcal T\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal U\\preceq_R\\mathcal T\n\\land\\neg(\\mathcal T\\preceq_R\\mathcal U),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}choice}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Choice}(R,\\mathfrak C)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\mathcal T\\in\\operatorname{Admissible}_R(\\mathfrak C)\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\neg\\exists\\mathcal U\\in\\operatorname{Admissible}_R(\\mathfrak C)\\,\n(\\mathcal U\\prec_R\\mathcal T)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>理论名称本身不能决定选择；至少要固定公理版本、比较语言、归纳强度、\n目标语义与可靠性要求。</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>首要要求</th>\n<th>可考虑的标准版本</th>\n<th>必须注意</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>对 PA 算术保守</td>\n<td>TB、UTB、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span></td>\n<td>不得偷偷加入真理语言归纳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强 Kleene 固定点语义</td>\n<td>KF；若背景逻辑也取部分逻辑则考虑 PKF</td>\n<td>KF 的对象演绎逻辑仍是经典的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>捕获/释放规则</td>\n<td>FS</td>\n<td>FS 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致超赋值语义</td>\n<td>VF</td>\n<td>VF 强于 KF，不能当作 KF 的三值变体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span></td>\n<td>标准全归纳 KF 等非保守理论</td>\n<td>不等于证明自身一致性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>如果偏好三值的强 Kleene 语义，应选 KF/PKF 路线，而不是 VF；\nVF 的标准联系是超赋值。若只需去引号而不增加算术后果，TB 或 UTB\n通常更合适。FS、KF、VF 的精确强度比较依赖公理版本、归纳与比较语言；\n不存在“共享真理谓词所以等强”的选择原则，也不能仅按名称预置一条\n无条件线性排序。</p>\n<p>偏好预序可能有多个极小元素，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Choice}\">\\(\\operatorname{Choice}\\)</span> 一般返回\n候选集，不是未经规则指定的唯一理论；若可接受集为空，返回空集。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-truth-theory-choice-—-按明确要求选择真理理论-$\\mathrm{Choice}$","text":"df-truth-theory-choice — 按明确要求选择真理理论 $\\mathrm{Choice}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-theory","status":"resolved","id":"024b320d234d188f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-strength","status":"resolved","id":"c87db4d1858a0009","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-strength]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Choice}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak C","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Meets}(\\mathcal T,r)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\preceq_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Admissible}_R(\\mathfrak C)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\mathcal T\\in\\mathfrak C\n\\mid\n\\forall r\\in R\\,\\operatorname{Meets}(\\mathcal T,r)\n\\right\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\prec_R\\mathcal T\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal U\\preceq_R\\mathcal T\n\\land\\neg(\\mathcal T\\preceq_R\\mathcal U),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}choice}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Choice}(R,\\mathfrak C)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\mathcal T\\in\\operatorname{Admissible}_R(\\mathfrak C)\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\neg\\exists\\mathcal U\\in\\operatorname{Admissible}_R(\\mathfrak C)\\,\n(\\mathcal U\\prec_R\\mathcal T)\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Choice}","display":false}],"bytes":2480,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-theory-choice]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-d